{
  "file": "module4",
  "page": 109,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.3926391601562,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "Considering this evidence and the totality of observed effects of the 9-month regimen with linezolid",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.3903198242188,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "on the outcomes, the panel judged that the 9-month regimen with linezolid may have moderate",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        405.09014892578125,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "desirable effects and that it may also have moderate undesirable effects.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.49463653564453,
        527.4353637695312,
        129.93763732910156
      ],
      "text": "Certainty in the estimates was rated “very low” for all outcomes owing to very serious risk of bias",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        128.69459533691406,
        527.6585083007812,
        143.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "(potential misclassification bias and confounding bias), inconsistency (inconsistency in the effect",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        141.8946075439453,
        527.4519653320312,
        156.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "estimates among 14 comparator cohorts) and indirectness (with data for the intervention regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.09474182128906,
        527.376220703125,
        169.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "being from a single country). The overall certainty is generally based on the lowest certainty for the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        168.29469299316406,
        351.95025634765625,
        182.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "agreed critical outcomes and thus was judged to be very low.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        189.9987335205078,
        527.6061401367188,
        204.4417266845703
      ],
      "text": "The panel noted that the costs for people with MDR/RR-TB receiving the 9-month regimen with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        203.19862365722656,
        527.4298706054688,
        217.64161682128906
      ],
      "text": "linezolid are expected to be lower than those for longer regimens (18 months or longer) because",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        216.3986358642578,
        359.175048828125,
        230.8416290283203
      ],
      "text": "costs for drugs, care and monitoring are expected to be lower.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        238.1024932861328,
        527.1580200195312,
        252.5454864501953
      ],
      "text": "The panel considered the ability to decentralize treatment (to enable access for remote, underserviced",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.961984634399414,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        251.30250549316406,
        527.1629028320312,
        265.7455139160156
      ],
      "text": "settings and disadvantaged populations) as affecting equity. Despite not being able to identify relevant",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.96163272857666,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        264.50262451171875,
        527.4354248046875,
        278.9456481933594
      ],
      "text": "research evidence, the panel used their collective experience to judge that there would probably be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        277.70257568359375,
        527.44970703125,
        292.1455993652344
      ],
      "text": "advantages associated with the use of the 9-month regimen owing to its reduced complexity and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        290.902587890625,
        527.385986328125,
        305.3456115722656
      ],
      "text": "shorter duration. The panel judged that use of the 9-month regimen with linezolid would probably",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        304.10247802734375,
        140.64019775390625,
        318.5455017089844
      ],
      "text": "increase equity.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        325.8065185546875,
        527.1920776367188,
        340.2495422363281
      ],
      "text": "The panel considered patients and health care providers as key stakeholders and the following",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        339.0065002441406,
        527.4234619140625,
        353.44952392578125
      ],
      "text": "aspects as critical with regard to acceptability: regimen duration and drug safety, monitoring needs",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        352.2065124511719,
        527.4058227539062,
        366.6495361328125
      ],
      "text": "(relating both to the necessary travel, loss of income and general disruption of the life of patients,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        365.406494140625,
        527.4378051757812,
        379.8495178222656
      ],
      "text": "and to workload for the health care system) and needs for DST. The panel judged that the 9-month",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        378.60650634765625,
        410.3107604980469,
        393.0495300292969
      ],
      "text": "regimen with linezolid would probably be acceptable to key stakeholders.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        400.3103942871094,
        527.436767578125,
        414.75341796875
      ],
      "text": "The balance of desirable and undesirable consequences was judged to not favour either the use of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        413.5104064941406,
        527.3916015625,
        427.95343017578125
      ],
      "text": "the 9-month regimen or the longer, 18-month regimens in this population. Specifically, the panel felt",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        426.7104187011719,
        527.3980102539062,
        441.1534423828125
      ],
      "text": "that there is a fine balance between the two options in terms of benefits and harms that is uncertain",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        439.910400390625,
        527.3883056640625,
        454.3534240722656
      ],
      "text": "given the overall very low certainty in the evidence. The panel judged that although the balance of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        453.11041259765625,
        527.4464721679688,
        467.5534362792969
      ],
      "text": "effects did not favour either the intervention or the comparator, several other evidence-to-decision",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        466.3103942871094,
        510.93109130859375,
        480.75341796875
      ],
      "text": "table criteria (e.g. resources, acceptability, equity and feasibility) favoured the 9-month regimen.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        488.014404296875,
        527.3914184570312,
        502.4574279785156
      ],
      "text": "Overall, the panel judged that either regimen could be used in the eligible patient group presented",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        501.21429443359375,
        527.4442138671875,
        515.6572875976562
      ],
      "text": "in the analysis; they noted the more limited eligibility for the 9-month regimen and acknowledged",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        514.4144287109375,
        527.3992309570312,
        528.857421875
      ],
      "text": "that the applicability of the longer, individualized regimens is more flexible and significantly broader,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        527.6143798828125,
        527.3892211914062,
        542.057373046875
      ],
      "text": "including many patient groups that are not eligible for the shorter regimen. These considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        540.8143920898438,
        489.3291931152344,
        555.2573852539062
      ],
      "text": "have also guided the agreement of the panel on the conditionality of this recommendation.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        568.631591796875,
        209.15652465820312,
        584.483642578125
      ],
      "text": "Subgroup considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        591.6915283203125,
        527.4497680664062,
        606.134521484375
      ],
      "text": "Based on research evidence and expert experience, the panel identified subpopulations of people",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        604.8914794921875,
        527.4530029296875,
        619.33447265625
      ],
      "text": "who might be affected differently than most by this recommendation; these subpopulations were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        618.0914916992188,
        527.5645751953125,
        632.5344848632812
      ],
      "text": "PLHIV, children, pregnant women, breastfeeding women, patients with extrapulmonary TB and patients",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.950739860534668,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        631.2916259765625,
        527.4453735351562,
        645.734619140625
      ],
      "text": "with extensive TB disease. The recent new recommendation for use of bedaquiline in children with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        643.2155151367188,
        527.4126586914062,
        658.9345092773438
      ],
      "text": "(30) MDR/RR-TB aged below 6 years was considered  . The panel noted specific considerations for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        657.6915283203125,
        220.8148651123047,
        672.134521484375
      ],
      "text": "the subpopulations listed below.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        688.535400390625,
        190.875732421875,
        704.1954345703125
      ],
      "text": "People living with HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        711.4033203125,
        527.4628295898438,
        725.8463134765625
      ],
      "text": "The data evaluated corresponded to a setting with a high prevalence of HIV; of particular significance",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.986441612243652,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        724.6033325195312,
        527.390380859375,
        739.0463256835938
      ],
      "text": "was that most PLHIV (>90%) who started the 9-month regimens were receiving ART. In view of the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        737.8032836914062,
        527.4508666992188,
        752.2462768554688
      ],
      "text": "treatment outcomes described in the analysis, there were no grounds to believe that the regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        751.00341796875,
        527.4443359375,
        765.4464111328125
      ],
      "text": "would perform any differently in PLHIV. It is necessary to consider significant clinical interactions that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        330.23760986328125,
        801.0170288085938,
        554.0401611328125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 2 Drug-resistant TB treatment: Recommendations  95",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}